beyond Christmas.


01:20:35.202 --> 01:20:37.963
I hear Nina travelled
around Europe for a while


01:20:38.122 --> 01:20:41.362
and eventually got a job
at a fancy restaurant in Rome.


01:20:41.521 --> 01:20:45.482
This year, her parents are going to
visit her for Thanksgiving.


01:20:51.600 --> 01:20:53.248
I'm not saying
what happened last Christmas


01:20:53.400 --> 01:20:55.484
happened solely
because of Nina.


01:20:56.840 --> 01:21:00.288
I'm saying maybe what happened
needed to happen,


01:21:00.440 --> 01:21:02.764
even for me.


01:21:05.320 --> 01:21:07.044
- Ah!
- Whoa! Whoa!


01:21:07.200 --> 01:21:09.087
My dad came into the city
the other day


01:21:09.240 --> 01:21:11.040
to celebrate my new job.


01:21:12.199 --> 01:21:14.720
He told me he offered the house
to my mom but...


01:21:14.880 --> 01:21:16.363
...she didn't want it.


01:21:16.520 --> 01:21:20.240
He thought about selling
but decided to hold onto it


01:21:20.399 --> 01:21:21.882
for when Toby and I
come visit.


01:21:22.039 --> 01:21:24.679
He's still
figuring things out.


01:21:24.839 --> 01:21:28.286
But, luckily, he has
his best friend to help with that.


01:22:48.754 --> 01:22:52.201
# I saw you, I found you


01:22:52.354 --> 01:22:55.681
# I watched you grow


01:22:55.833 --> 01:22:58.681
# Slowly but surely


01:22:58.834 --> 01:23:02.914
# We ebb and we ﬂow


01:23:03.073 --> 01:23:06.401
# I felt a change


01:23:06.552 --> 01:23:09.957
# Deep in my bones


01:23:10.112 --> 01:23:14.837
# Something new


01:23:14.992 --> 01:23:17.033
# Has grown


01:23:22.632 --> 01:23:25.959
# I was inside waiting


01:23:26.112 --> 01:23:29.559
# Eyes open wide


01:23:29.711 --> 01:23:35.396
# I felt the ground beneath me wake


01:23:36.831 --> 01:23:40.236
# I felt a change


01:23:40.391 --> 01:23:43.839
# Deep in my bones


01:23:43.990 --> 01:23:49.555
# Something new


01:23:49.711 --> 01:23:51.794
# Has grown


01:24:05.229 --> 01:24:07.749
# Up in your room


01:24:07.909 --> 01:24:12.274
# Was a great silent storm


01:24:12.429 --> 01:24:13.673
# Clouds have cleared


01:24:13.829 --> 01:24:18.313
# The air was sweet and warm. #

